# Equinox counters a spell whose every way destroys a land you control, though a question comes first (CR 608.2, 616.1):
# Pyramids has shielded Bot1's Island and Bot2's Rest in Peace offers another replacement for its destruction, so Armageddon
# asks Bot1 which applies first before anything is destroyed. Whichever Bot1 chooses, Armageddon destroys Bot1's Plains, a
# land destroyed though Rest in Peace exiles it (Indomitable Creativity's ruling of 2017-02-09), so it is countered - and
# Rest in Peace exiles it - and every land stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Pyramids
Equinox
Island
Plains x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Rest in Peace
Black Lotus
Armageddon
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyramids.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Ability: Add)
Bot1.Hand.Equinox.Cast(Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Rest in Peace.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Armageddon.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Pyramids.Activate
Bot1.Modes(The next time target land)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Stack.Armageddon; Ability: Counter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Equinox; Island; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Plains; Pyramids
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Plains; Rest in Peace
Exile = Armageddon; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
